

Barnaamij nadiifi.


>> Veggy := Walax cusub.
Veggy marka: ['cusub'] samee: {
	>> v := naf cusub.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy marka: ['init'] samee: { iska-leh veggies := 0. }.

Veggy marka: ['carrots:'] samee: { :a iska-leh veggies := a. <- Waxba. }.
Veggy marka: ['carrots'] samee: { <- iska-leh veggies. }.
Veggy marka: ['+'] samee: { :f
	>> n := Veggy cusub.
	n carrots: (f carrots + iska-leh veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy marka: ['qoraal'] samee: { <- iska-leh veggies qoraal.
}.

Tiro marka: ['carrots'] samee: {
	>> x := Veggy cusub.
	x carrots: naf. <- x.
}.

Tiro marka: ['add:and:'] samee: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Soo-saar qor: q, sadar-cusub.
